OL,3,GNEWSARenewable energy in NI reaches
OL,4,Arecord level
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than half (53%) of Northern
OL,7,FIreland's electricity came from
OL,8,Frenewable sources in the year to June `
OL,9,Fbeating the level previously set in
OL,10,F2022.
OL,12,FAnd for the first time renewable
OL,13,Fgeneration has consistently exceeded
OL,14,Fnon-renewable generation since January.
OL,16,FEven when imported electricity was
OL,17,Ftaken into account, the amount of
OL,18,Frenewables equalled the previous record
OL,19,Fof 50%, set in 2022/23.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
