OL,3,GNEWSARenewable energy in NI reaches
OL,4,Arecord level
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Economy Minister Caoimhe Archibald
OL,7,Fsaid the increasing level of renewable
OL,8,Fenergy would help Northern Ireland
OL,9,F"move away from price volatility and
OL,10,Ftowards more stable and fairer prices".
